{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mantian-e-p159a","title":"王恺讽荀恺令都官诬奏牵秀","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-f20e75584c38c4c78dc3","label":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","text":"王恺讽荀恺令都官诬奏牵秀","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mantian-p0028","role":"素轻侮秀、讽荀恺令诬奏","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0055","role":"受讽令都官诬奏","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3"]},{"person":"luxun-p0085","role":"被诬奏","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","source_order":[26,281,100],"order":5245}],"persons":[{"id":"mantian-p0028","name":"王恺","evidence":["mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","zhonghua-q2-d1df29374542442a82b2"],"facts":[{"id":"zhonghua-f2-a3e13f7269fd61be806c","text":"《晋诸公赞》记王恺为王虔弟，字君夫，终于后将军。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-d1df29374542442a82b2"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"与帝舅黄门侍郎王恺，素相轻侮。恺讽司隶荀恺，令都官诬奏秀‘夜在道中，载高平国守士田兴妻’","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":100,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q2-d1df29374542442a82b2","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-231467f9a0e021c8a927","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“恂，字（子良大）〔良夫〕。有通识，在朝忠正。历河南尹、侍中，所居有称。乃心存公，有匪躬之节。鬲令袁毅，馈以骏马；知其贪财，不受：毅竟以黩货而败。建立二学，崇明五经，皆恂所建。卒时年四十余，赠车骑将军。肃女，适司马文王，即文明皇后；生晋武帝、齐献王攸。”《晋诸公赞》曰：“恂兄弟八人。其达者：虔字恭祖，以功干见称，位至尚书；弟恺，字君夫，少有才力而无行检，与卫尉石崇友善，俱以豪侈竞于世，终于后将军。虔子康、隆，仕亦宦达，为后世所重。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":498,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0788cdb2196c07c9412c","start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
